00:10:20.160 --> 00:10:24.160
and he just said something that was mind blowing&nbsp;
to me he said uh you know he was fortunate because&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:24.160 --> 00:10:29.120
he had a family that he could go and stay with&nbsp;
but dealing with like a lot of the bureaucracy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:29.120 --> 00:10:35.840
around um the uh you know support for the&nbsp;
veterans uh he was saying that a lot of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.840 --> 00:10:38.880
the guys he knew in the hospital went straight&nbsp;
from the hospital to the streets if they didn't&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:38.880 --> 00:10:44.400
have a place to go because their disability pay&nbsp;
would take so long to uh to be able to come in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:45.360 --> 00:10:49.840
and that just boggled my mind and so i spent&nbsp;
