00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:27.200
just trying to as much as i could understand&nbsp;
that and then bring it to life in in a way that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:27.200 --> 00:11:31.520
i was hoping for other people like me who are&nbsp;
